 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Added
+
+- Add `v1` `Files.Upload`, which uploads a file from a name and an `io.Reader`
+  and builds the `multipart/form-data` body for you, mirroring
+  `CallLogs.AddRecording`. The body is buffered so retries can replay it.
+
+### Fixed
+
+- Retry uploads that stream from a seekable reader such as an `*os.File`.
+  `Raw.Do` now sets `GetBody` for seekable request bodies, so rate-limited
+  (429) and gateway-error (5xx) uploads made through `Files.Add`/`Files.Update`
+  are retried instead of failing on the first attempt. Previously only
+  `net/http`'s recognized in-memory reader types (buffered/JSON bodies) were
+  replayable; seekable readers are no longer closed by the SDK between attempts.
+
 ## [1.11.0] - 2026-08-18
 
